			"x": 1045,
			"y": -1920,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 79,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "cb5b88026ee8ab9c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Minimal Theory of Change.md",
			"x": 1860,
			"y": -2260,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 63,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "e341962ee71fd4ac",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Review Research and Feedback.md",
			"x": 1860,
			"y": -1993,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 78,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "21ce0a1cac5e9f9b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Adaptability and Extensibility.md",
			"x": 2458,
			"y": -2260,
			"width": 292,
			"height": 89,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "d0f61d311461a2d4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When the selected development approach does not match uncertainty, risk, participation needs, or legitimacy requirements",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2323,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "9187d7bf88bcab89",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When the standard appears justified but phases, testing, infrastructure, roles, decision rights, or release logic are not ready",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2239,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "90d42d751c1414ee",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When the maintenance burden, stewardship model, funding assumptions, adopter cost, or continuity plan are not credible",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2155,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "d955f333c01a4fce",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When the work is technically ready but lacks sufficient consent, authorization, commitment, or recorded conditions for progression",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2072,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "47a855df1fdd0d30",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When the causal pathway is weak, assumptions are doing too much work, or the standard’s expected mechanism of change is unclear",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2659,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "011769c6cd5f8c87",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When reuse, extension, interoperability, or “use something else” questions remain unresolved",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2574,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "207ea5acb1ae11ac",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When participation is too narrow, representation gaps are material, or there are no credible shapers/testers/early adopters",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2490,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "47c9737f054a3b79",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When scope is too broad, too vague, or the essential feature set is not yet distinguishable from optional work",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2406,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "a6b7c7aa8e240e00",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Understand Ecosystem.md",
			"x": 5400,
			"y": -2813,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "1c47676d8fe58e27",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Decide On Aims and Objectives.md",
			"x": 5400,
			"y": -2739,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 73,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "d0e86e9d188e3041",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Minimal Theory of Change.md",
			"x": 5400,
			"y": -2642,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 50,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "72ed595d8f71f75d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Identify Current Ecosystem Standards.md",
			"x": 5400,
			"y": -2571,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 81,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "0feb04ea69188dd9",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Information Exchange.md",
			"x": 505,
			"y": -2080,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 87,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "40dd703a89809baf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When the problem/opportunity remains vague, competing frames are unresolved, or new evidence contradicts the original framing",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2912,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "3589859348dacad6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When important actors, relationships, infrastructure, standards, control points, or dependencies are still poorly understood",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2828,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "5fee9163c27fc97c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "When the intended change is unclear, objectives conflict, or the proposed standard no longer plausibly supports the stated aim",
			"x": 4815,
			"y": -2745,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 84,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "01b47a62cc5a0e0d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Open Standards Main Map/Frame the Opportunity.md",
			"x": 5400,
			"y": -2901,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 63,
